  ("A. Gelbukh and G. Sidorov" 0.1770 0.4075 0.0439 0.0564 0.0564 0.0125 0.0054 0.3382 0.0200)
  ("Here, a_{ij} is the value in the (i,j)-th cell of the chart, T_{X} [a .. b] is the set of the para-" 0.1246 0.9032 0.0870 0.1020 0.1007 0.0138 0.0067 0.2919 0.0510)
  ("graphs from a-th to b-th inclusive of the text in the language X, and the minimum is" 0.0981 0.9025 0.1045 0.1183 0.1181 0.0138 0.0076 0.2942 0.0617)
  ("calculated over all cells (x,y) in the ┘-shaped area to the left and above the (i,j)-th" 0.0981 0.9025 0.1190 0.1358 0.1357 0.0138 0.0090 0.2168 0.0941)
  ("cell, as marked with a triple-line border in Fig. 6. In our implementation we star from" 0.0981 0.9028 0.1394 0.1532 0.1532 0.0138 0.0065 0.3253 0.0392)
